
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head page-head--art">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">For accounting and professional firms</span>
        <h1>Your clients ask the same questions. Let AI draft the answers.</h1>
        <figure class="ph-art ph-art--phone" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/art/phone-accounts.webp?v=1" alt="" width="600" height="1005" /></figure>
        <p class="lead">&ldquo;Which documents do you need?&rdquo;, &ldquo;when is my return due?&rdquo;, &ldquo;how do I pay?&rdquo;: drafted in seconds from your own deadlines, document lists and fees, for your team to check and send. Busy season stops meaning new clients wait days.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-accountants-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
          <a href="inbox-assistant#try" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large" data-track="cta-accountants-demo">Try it on a client email</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="painTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Where the day goes</span><h2 id="painTitle">The messages that eat your day.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--3">
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-6l-2 3h-4l-2-3H2"/><path d="M5.5 5.1 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.5-6.9A2 2 0 0 0 16.8 4H7.2a2 2 0 0 0-1.7 1.1z"/></svg></span><h3>The same questions all day</h3><p>&ldquo;Which documents do you need?&rdquo;, &ldquo;when is it due?&rdquo;, &ldquo;did you get my IRP5?&rdquo;. Typed again between real work.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><h3>New clients wait in busy season</h3><p>A new enquiry sits under 60 status emails. By the time someone replies, they&rsquo;ve asked another practice.</p></div>
          <div class="card reveal"><span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M9 13h6M9 17h4"/></svg></span><h3>Chasing documents by hand</h3><p>Reminders for missing certificates and statements, written one at a time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

