    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">A fixed price before anything starts.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <div class="reveal">
            <ul class="price-list">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Lots of customer email (20+ a day)? Inbox Assistant<small>Routine email replies drafted for your team. <span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span> setup + <span data-zar="2950">R2,950</span>/mo, with a <span data-zar="1500">R1,500</span> deposit to start, refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save 5 hours a week</small></div><span class="price"><small>setup</small><span data-zar="9500">R9,500</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Document chasing and reminders<small>One automation: requests and reminders for missing documents, sent for you</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="15000">R15,000</span></span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Answers from your own files<small>Staff ask in plain words and get the answer and where it came from. Then from <span data-zar="7500">R7,500</span>/mo to keep it running</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small><span data-zar="25000">R25,000</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:.8rem">A fixed quote before anything starts, and you can stop after any stage. No VAT is added: we&rsquo;re not VAT-registered.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="industry-side">
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>Not sure it&rsquo;s worth it?</h3>
            <p>That&rsquo;s what the free call is for. Tell us roughly how many messages and calls you get. We&rsquo;ll tell you honestly whether AI would save real hours, and if not, we&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:.6rem">Fewer than 20 client emails a day? We&rsquo;ll tell you on the call that it probably isn&rsquo;t worth it yet, and suggest something simpler.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points for typical practices. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list &rarr;</a></p>
          </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h2 id="howTitle">From first call to drafted replies.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps steps--4 reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Free 30-minute call</h3><p>You tell us what comes in and what eats the day. We say honestly whether AI fits.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>A R1,500 deposit</h3><p>Refunded in full if it doesn&rsquo;t save your team 5 hours a week. We time the work with you on day one.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Your page within 3 business days</h3><p>Loaded with your deadlines, document lists, fees and the way you like to reply.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Two weeks on real emails</h3><p>Your team marks how each reply went. Saving 5+ hours a week? Then the rest is due. If not, the deposit comes back.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions practices ask</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Will it give tax or legal advice?</summary><p>No. It answers only from the deadlines, document lists and fees you give us, and anything that needs professional judgement is marked for a person to check before anything is sent.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is client information safe?</summary><p>It&rsquo;s used only to draft your replies, under POPIA. Drafts are written by our own AI computer, in South Africa, so client emails don&rsquo;t go to any outside AI company and aren&rsquo;t used to train AI models; their brief stop on our server outside South Africa is protected the way POPIA requires. We don&rsquo;t keep the emails you paste, and you can sign our data processing agreement and a mutual NDA first.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>We use a practice management system. Does it work with it?</summary><p>Yes, alongside it: your team pastes the email into your private page and copies the reply back. On Microsoft 365 the drafts can wait in your inbox instead.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Who will we deal with?</summary><p>A small studio: the person on your free call builds it and answers your messages, with no call centre or hand-offs. It&rsquo;s documented and runs in accounts you own, so any developer can pick it up.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">More in the <a class="inline-link" href="pricing#faq">general FAQ</a>. Also for: <a class="inline-link" href="for-salons">Salons</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-plumbers">Plumbers & trades</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-restaurants">Restaurants</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="for-cleaners">Cleaning services</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">For accounting and professional firms</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Tell us what takes too long.</h2>
        <p>A free 30-minute call on Google Meet, or we phone you. You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-accountants-book-end">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <p class="cta__alt">Rather we phone you? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-call-open>Pick a time</button> &middot; Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in two lines</button></p>
        <p class="small muted" data-contact-block hidden>Rather message? <a class="inline-link" href="#" data-contact="whatsapp" hidden>WhatsApp us</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

